{"id":"zhalet_","lemma":"жалеть","pos":"verb","rank":2505,"glosses":["to feel sorry, to be sorry, to be sad (about something), to regret","to pity, to commiserate","to save, to spare (e.g. time, energy)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b6/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B6%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"жалею","2s":"жалеешь","3s":"жалеет","1p":"жалеем","2p":"жалеете","3p":"жалеют"},"future":{"1s":"буду жалеть","2s":"будешь жалеть","3s":"будет жалеть","1p":"будем жалеть","2p":"будете жалеть","3p":"будут жалеть"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"жалей","2p":"жалейте"}}},"past":{"m":"жалел","p":"жалели","f":"жалела","n":"жалело"},"aspect":"imperfective","aspectPartner":"пожалеть","examples":[{"text":"О чём ты жалеешь?","en":"What are you sorry about?","words":[{"g":"about"},{"g":"what","l":"что"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Я жалею, что сказал тебе правду.","en":"I regret telling you the truth.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Ненавижу себя жалеть.","en":"I hate feeling sorry for myself.","words":[{"g":"to hate","l":"ненавидеть"},{"g":"oneself"},null]},{"text":"О чём вы жалеете?","en":"What are you sorry about?","words":[{"g":"about"},{"g":"what","l":"что"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null]},{"text":"Он, конечно, не жалеет своих денег.","en":"He's certainly generous with his money.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"of course, certainly"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},{"g":"money","l":"деньги"}]}]}